<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1360967213"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1459206030"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Write My Voice"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YuNi"/><amll:meta key="album" value="clear"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="01:06.893"><div begin="00:06.645" end="03:30.897"><p begin="00:06.645" end="00:09.323" itunes:key="L107006">始まりの鐘がほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宣告一切开始的钟声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji ma ri no ka ne ga ho ra</span></p><p begin="00:09.455" end="00:12.406" itunes:key="L107007">透き通るように響いていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清透回响着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki to o ru yo u ni hi bi i te i ta</span></p><p begin="00:12.522" end="00:18.164" itunes:key="L107008">ずっとずっと見えない果ての果てまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断 不断回响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to zu 't to</span></p><p begin="00:18.366" end="00:21.206" itunes:key="L107009">不確かだった感覚は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不确切的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta shi ka da 't ta ka n ka ku ha</span></p><p begin="00:21.263" end="00:24.265" itunes:key="L107010">少しずつ熱を帯びて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点点沾染热量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi zu tsu ne tsu wo o bi te</span></p><p begin="00:24.281" end="00:29.147" itunes:key="L107011">ねぇもうすぐそこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那在身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mo u su gu so ko</span></p><p begin="00:29.175" end="00:31.974" itunes:key="L107012">小さかった言葉達が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渺小的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa ka 't ta ko to ba ta chi ga</span></p><p begin="00:32.114" end="00:35.016" itunes:key="L107013">目の前を照らしたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮了眼前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me no ma e wo te ra shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:35.132" end="00:40.554" itunes:key="L107014">今は未来も見えるくらい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 已能依稀看将未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ha mi ra i mo mi e ru ku ra i</span></p><p begin="00:40.593" end="00:47.253" itunes:key="L107015">もっともっと 遠く知らない場所まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续 继续向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to mo 't to</span></p><p begin="00:47.263" end="00:52.454" itunes:key="L107016">この声で君と明日を描きたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿借这声线 描绘出你的身影与未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko e de ki mi to a su wo e ga ki ta i</span></p><p begin="00:52.482" end="00:59.026" itunes:key="L107017">いつかいつか 全て彩れるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿终有一天 一切都能沾染色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka i tsu ka su be te i ro do re ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:59.153" end="01:08.549" itunes:key="L107018">奏で続けた日々で 歌を綴ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在不断鸣奏的时光中 缀以歌声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na de tsu du ke ta hi bi de u ta wo tsu du ro u</span></p><p begin="01:29.560" end="01:32.323" itunes:key="L107019">空想が鍵かけていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放松的空想 被紧紧上锁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku u so u ga ka gi ka ke te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:32.456" end="01:35.272" itunes:key="L107020">隔たり超えた先は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨过隔阂后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he da ta ri wo ko e ta sa ki ha</span></p><p begin="01:35.381" end="01:40.834" itunes:key="L107021">きっと君の体温で満たされている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我定能因你的体温而感到满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to ki mi no ta i o n de mi ta sa re te ru</span></p><p begin="01:41.336" end="01:44.125" itunes:key="L107022">白く冷たいキャンパスに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在纯白冰冷的画布上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ro ku tsu me ta i kya n ba su ni</span></p><p begin="01:44.292" end="01:47.265" itunes:key="L107023">積み上げた音の行方<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断累积乐声的行踪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi a ge ta o to no yu ku e</span></p><p begin="01:47.282" end="01:52.040" itunes:key="L107024">今なら届くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 我定能将歌声传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra to do ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:52.076" end="01:57.977" itunes:key="L107025">共鳴が響く世界が 大切な今になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断回响着共鸣的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u me i ga hi bi ku se ka i ga</span></p><p begin="01:58.004" end="02:03.544" itunes:key="L107026">次の未来を紡いでいく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点点编织出今后的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu gi no mi ra i mo tsu mu i de ku</span></p><p begin="02:03.577" end="02:09.947" itunes:key="L107027">ずっとずっと 遠く果てない時まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断 不断延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to zu 't to</span></p><p begin="02:10.274" end="02:15.397" itunes:key="L107028">この声が君の傍にいて欲しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿能这声音都能陪伴在你身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko e ga ki mi no so ba ni i te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="02:15.514" end="02:21.998" itunes:key="L107029">いつかいつか 願いが火を灯すように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿终有一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka i tsu ka</span></p><p begin="02:22.014" end="02:31.593" itunes:key="L107030">信じ続けた日々で 歌を綴ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在坚定的时光中 缀以歌声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji tsu du ke ta hi bi de u ta wo tsu du ro u</span></p><p begin="02:40.599" end="02:45.705" itunes:key="L107031">淡く夢見ていた風景は いつの日か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦中淡薄的风景 终有一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa ku yu me mi te i ta fu u ke i ha i tsu no hi ka</span></p><p begin="02:46.646" end="02:52.491" itunes:key="L107032">今にも触れられそうな近さで 輝いてるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会在触手可及的身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ni mo fu re ra re so u na chi ka sa de</span></p><p begin="02:52.519" end="02:57.365" itunes:key="L107033">数えきれないほどの君の声 ひとつひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你数不清的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka zo e ki re na i ho do no ki mi no ko e</span></p><p begin="02:57.375" end="03:02.795" itunes:key="L107034">この背中を押してくれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点点滴滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se na ka wo o shi te ku re ru</span></p><p begin="03:02.840" end="03:09.268" itunes:key="L107035">もっともっと 遠く知らない場所まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续 继续向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to mo 't to</span></p><p begin="03:09.600" end="03:14.658" itunes:key="L107036">この声で君と未来描きたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿借这声线 描绘出你的身影与未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko e de ki mi to mi ra i wo e ga ki ta i</span></p><p begin="03:14.812" end="03:21.319" itunes:key="L107037">いつかいつか 静かな風を纏って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka i tsu ka</span></p><p begin="03:21.358" end="03:30.897" itunes:key="L107038">奏で続けた日々は 歌を刻む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将不断鸣奏的时光 烙于歌声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na de tsu du ke ta hi bi ha u ta wo ki za mu</span></p></div></body></tt>